
# AI Code Evaluator

A Python-based code evaluation tool that checks candidate solutions against predefined test cases and generates an evaluation report.

## Features

- Evaluates Python functions against test cases.
- Detects correct and incorrect outputs.
- Handles runtime exceptions.
- Generates evaluation reports.
- Calculates test pass rates.
- Supports edge-case testing.
- Includes automated tests using pytest.

## Technologies Used

- Python 3.12
- pytest

## Project Structure

AI-Code-Evaluator/
- evaluator.py
- test_evaluator.py
- main.py
- README.md

## Setup

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone YOUR_GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL
cd AI-Code-Evaluator
```

Create a virtual environment:

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

Activate on Windows:

```powershell
.\venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
```

Install pytest:

```bash
pip install pytest
```

## Run the Evaluator

```bash
python main.py
```

## Run Automated Tests

```bash
pytest -v
```

## Current Scope

This project evaluates Python functions using predefined test cases. It currently uses sample candidate solutions and does not directly connect to an AI model or execute arbitrary source code.

